# opsx-static-check infra invariants

1. Cursor agent files under `.cursor/agents/opsx-sc-*.md` stay **thin**: frontmatter + LOAD list + “return packet”. No embedded tool command matrices.
2. Check details live only in `.cursor/static-check/checks/<id>/`.
3. Composition of MODE/waves lives only in `.cursor/static-check/registry.yaml`.
4. Workers are READ_ONLY; no autofix; no archive `GO`/`NO_GO`.
5. Do not reintroduce a second SoT (`opsx-static-check-workers/` or fat agent copies).
6. Shell: Poetry from repo root; PowerShell-safe one-liners by default; git-bash only per `base/shell.md`.
